---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import site from '../../data/site.json';
---

<Base
  title={`Digital Delivery Policy | ${site.brandName}`}
  description={`Details on digital service delivery timelines and methods provided by ${site.brandName}.`}
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8 sm:py-16 space-y-10">
    <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Digital Delivery Policy' }]} />

    <div class="space-y-3">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Digital Service Delivery Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Last Updated: October 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-6 text-slate-700 bg-white p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
      <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">1. Nature of Products & Delivery</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>{site.brandName}</strong> provides 100% digital, electronic, and intangible services. <strong>No physical parcels, paper packages, or tangible media are shipped.</strong> All deliveries are completed electronically over secure internet channels.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">2. Methods of Delivery</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
        <li><strong>Remote Diagnostic & IT Support:</strong> Delivered in real-time via secure remote desktop software (AnyDesk, TeamViewer) and live WhatsApp voice or chat coordination.</li>
        <li><strong>Graphic Design, PDF & Document Files:</strong> High-resolution export files (PNG, SVG, PDF, DOCX) delivered via secure cloud download links (Google Drive) and email.</li>
        <li><strong>Websites & Software Applications:</strong> Delivered by deploying live code to client hosting/domain (Cloudflare Pages, Vercel, cPanel) or transferring GitHub code repositories.</li>
        <li><strong>Consultation Sessions:</strong> Delivered via scheduled WhatsApp audio or chat consultation accompanied by a written Action Summary PDF.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">3. Standard Turnaround Timelines</h2>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse border border-slate-200 my-4 text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-200 font-bold">
              <th class="p-3">Service Category</th>
              <th class="p-3">Delivery Timeline</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-100">
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-semibold">Remote Computer Quick Fixes</td>
              <td class="p-3">Same day (within 1 to 4 hours of payment)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-semibold">Document & PDF Tasks</td>
              <td class="p-3">Within 24 hours</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-semibold">Logo & Ad Design Creatives</td>
              <td class="p-3">24 to 48 hours</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-semibold">Google Business Profile / Maps Setup</td>
              <td class="p-3">2 to 4 working days (subject to Google review)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-semibold">Standard Business Website</td>
              <td class="p-3">5 to 8 working days upon receipt of content</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-semibold">Custom Web / Android Apps</td>
              <td class="p-3">Milestone-based (agreed upon project kickoff)</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">4. Confirmation of Delivery</h2>
      <p>
        Upon completion of any service, a formal handover notification along with links, access credentials (where applicable), and deliverables is sent via email and WhatsApp to the client. The client is given 48 hours to review and request revisions.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">5. Delivery Support Inquiries</h2>
      <p>
        If you experience any delay or difficulty accessing your digital deliverables, contact us immediately:
        <br />
        WhatsApp: <strong>{site.whatsappDisplay}</strong>
        <br />
        Email: <strong>{site.email}</strong>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
